6-10-12T12:56:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T12:56:29Z"}],"body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n* ✨ feat(bench): add -L/--directory to search extra module directories by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2482\r\n* ✨ feat(bench): show progress bars while running benches by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2521\r\n* ✨ feat(lang): recover from broken input in the CST parser by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2495\r\n* ✨ feat(lang): add math, array, dict and string builtins by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2499\r\n* ✨ feat(lang): add fn: lambda without a parameter list by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2528\r\n* ✨ feat(lang): add csv::sort_rows by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2556\r\n* ✨ feat(run): treat `-` as stdin in input file arguments by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2476\r\n* ✨ feat(run): gate -o/--output behind --allow-write under --sandbox by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2494\r\n* ✨ feat(run): show mq-dbg in the repl banner by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2557\r\n* ✨ feat(test): add -L option to search extra module directories by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2520\r\n* ✨ feat(chrome-extension): add example queries for links, tables, code, sections by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2464\r\n* 🧹 chore: remove no-op std feature, add Windows ARM64 binaries, tighten mq-check API by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2545\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n\r\n* 🐛 fix(mq-check): reduce false positives on dynamic mq code  by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2522\r\n* 🐛 fix(lang): limit parser nesting depth to avoid stack overflow by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2475\r\n* 🐛 fix(lang): apply binary operator precedence in the CST parser by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2504\r\n* 🐛 fix(lang): return none for Markdown selectors on plain dicts by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2513\r\n* 🐛 fix(lang): report accurate locations for errors inside string interpolation by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2517\r\n* 🐛 fix(lang): give an attr call its own token id by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2549\r\n* 🐛 fix(mq-markdown): improve html to markdown conversion quality  by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2512\r\n* 🐛 fix(run): include file path in input file read errors by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2474\r\n* 🐛 fix(test): keep running after a test errors and group file errors at the end by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2555\r\n* fix(builtin): return None from to_h, to_code, to_math when input is None by @opencode13241-eng in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2490\r\n* 🐛 fix(csv): keep 0/false, union dict keys, and escape control chars by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2485\r\n* 🐛 fix(json): write inf/NaN as null and fix markdown table edge cases by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2486\r\n* 🐛 fix(scripts): pass version to bump_version module functions by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2560\r\n* 🐛 fix(toml): fix datetime/inf/nan parsing and emit nested tables as [a.b] by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2484\r\n* 🐛 fix(yaml): fix parsing of .inf and non-string keys and improve stringify output by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2483\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\n* 📝 docs: add MacPorts installation instructions by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2473\r\n* 📝 docs: make AGENTS.md specific to this repository by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2519\r\n\r\n### Refactoring\r\n\r\n* ♻️ refactor(bench): index sorted durations instead of unwrapping first/last by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2551\r\n* ♻️ refactor(help): move builtin docs from mq-lang to mq-help by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2535\r\n* ♻️ refactor(help): list feature-gated builtins only when they are enabled by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2536\r\n* ♻️ refactor(lang): shrink StackValue from 24 to 16 bytes by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2471\r\n* ♻️ refactor(lang): share binary operator precedence between parsers and by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2514\r\n* ♻️ refactor(lang): derive suggestion candidates from the builtin registry by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2534\r\n* ♻️ refactor(lang)!: make DictMap a newtype over the backing map by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2539\r\n* ♻️ refactor(lang): end non-root program bodies at , and closing brackets by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2546\r\n* ♻️ refactor(lang): store tokens by value in the token arena by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2548\r\n* 🔧 build(run): fail the mq release build when debugger leaks in by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2558\r\n\r\n### Performance\r\n\r\n* ⚡perf(mq-check): mq check accuracy and performance by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2526\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): replace the nom lexer with a hand-written one by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2505\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): append to string locals in place and borrow self for builtin calls by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2506\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): thread jumps through jumps and into returns by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2507\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): branch on negated conditions with JumpIfTrue by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2509\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): compile && and || in conditions into direct jumps by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2510\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): compile prefix `!` and `-` to VM opcodes through a UnaryOp node by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2511\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): bind native builtins at compile time with CallNative by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2515\r\n* ⚡ perf(lang): update index assignments and array appends in place by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2516\r\n* ⚡ perf(vm): reuse scalar bytecode constants by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2463\r\n\r\n### Test\r\n\r\n* ✅ test(mq-run): use FIFO instead of Unix socket in atomic_output tests by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2472\r\n* test(mq-run): use message helper in test_usage_errors by @opencode13241-eng in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2477\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Dependency Updates</summary>\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): bump rand from 0.10.2 to 0.10.3 in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2468\r\n* chore(deps): bump taiki-e/install-action from 2.87.15 to 2.87.17 in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2469\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2479\r\n* Revert \"chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 2 updates\" by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2481\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2492\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2497\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group across 1 directory with 4 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2498\r\n* chore(deps): bump smallvec from 1.16.1 to 1.16.2 in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2503\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2525\r\n* chore(deps): bump rust from 1.98.0-slim to 1.98.1-slim in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2530\r\n* chore(deps): bump taiki-e/install-action from 2.87.21 to 2.87.22 in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2532\r\n* chore(deps): bump CodSpeedHQ/action from 5.2.1 to 5.4.0 in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2543\r\n* chore(deps): bump libc from 0.2.189 to 0.2.190 in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2544\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump the dependencies group in /editors/vscode with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2465\r\n* chore(deps): bump brace-expansion in /editors/vscode by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2480\r\n* chore(deps): bump vscode-languageclient from 10.1.1 to 10.1.2 in /editors/vscode in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2500\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump the dependencies group in /editors/vscode with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2524\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump shell-quote from 1.10.0 to 1.12.0 in /editors/vscode by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2533\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump the dependencies group in /editors/vscode with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2542\r\n* ⬆️ chore(deps): bump npm dependencies in web packages by @harehare in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2529\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump the dependencies group in /packages/mq-playground with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2467\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump the dependencies group in /packages/mq-playground with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/harehare/mq/pull/2478\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump @babel/core from 7.29.7 to 8.0.6 in /packages/mq-playground in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https:/